# The engine writes every render here: project.json, build/ and out/ for each job. Untracked and never
# committed, but not ignored either — so a run interrupted before its cleanup left a whole rendered video sitting
# in the shared working tree, ready for the next `git add -A` from any of the sessions that share it.
worker/keou/projects/

# rendered films and evidence pulled from boxes: never in git (GitHub refuses >100 MB, and they are not source)
scripts/motion-demo/out/

# private key that proves kleooai.com to the MCP Registry (mcp-publisher login http)
.mcp-registry-key.pem
